cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the model identifier, version and immutable Git commit used. This repository is a model release, not evidence of journal publication."
type: software
title: "Learned Stabilisation-Parameter Models for Incompressible Navier-Stokes"
abstract: >
  Trained inference models for the learned stabilisation parameter tau of a
  SUPG/PSPG/LSIC stabilised finite-element incompressible Navier-Stokes solver.
  The September 2026 release adds twelve experimental 14-feature causal models
  with normalization, synthetic inference fixtures and documented validation
  limitations. Legacy PC-AiStab and ADJSTAB models remain available separately.
  The finite-element solver, training code and training corpus are not released.
